WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.279
Why keep an API running all night for one morning request?

00:00:04.208 --> 00:00:06.598
Call your existing endpoint through SlimFaas.

00:00:06.598 --> 00:00:09.328
It wakes a worker and returns your handler’s answer.

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:12.383
Thirty calculations arrived at once.

00:00:12.383 --> 00:00:15.349
The callers could move on while four workers shared the load.

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:17.423
All thirty finished.

00:00:17.423 --> 00:00:19.237
The workers scaled back to zero.

00:00:20.167 --> 00:00:24.540
One team reported cutting its infrastructure costs by more than sixty percent.

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:29.469
Try SlimFaas locally with one of your own HTTP endpoints.
